{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_07",
  "title": "生靈火花",
  "storyCode": "FC-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f4c20f12a83c1cda55e701e24e84cc47e3a5c5b80b631ca7749a7c29fb4e2d94",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g4_swamp_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一等，阿赫茉妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前方公路關卡的駐軍數量有些異常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您注意到了？我恰好還告訴過他們留意......這裡也許會發生一些破壞公爵間關係的事件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以你必須趕在那些人離開特倫特郡轄區之前動手圍捕，這樣你留的後手才能夠起效。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不算意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......威靈頓公爵手下，赤鐵近衛隊的長官，當然，這個身份很快就威脅不到您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，您至少很清楚，繼續追擊下去，事情會變成兩位大公爵的領地爭端。在當前維多利亞的局勢下，恐怕沒人想看到這樣的衝突發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，為什麼你總是不給我留一些選擇餘地呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，現在這樣也夠了，我的任務也已經完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的失誤造成了這樣的惡果。作為身份已經暴露的間諜，你沒有必要再如此盡職地虛張聲勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？我可是真心希望，我們能共同為有朝一日的合作付出努力——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿赫茉妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在台上說的話已經夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人，收隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這原本就是一場敗仗，先放過他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我提醒過你，菲舍爾。礦石病發展到一定程度之後，這些止痛藥就不管用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的情況，就是你長時間持續使用源石技藝的後果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好吧，如果我話說得太重，我道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我只是在想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尊敬的開斯特公爵竟然派來了一位“灰禮帽”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我甚至不知道......那位公爵的密使是什麼時候取代了我的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g4_swamp_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......哈......我們，我們是不是逃出來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，後面看不到追兵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先停下來檢查一下受傷的情況吧，及時處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們......失去了幾名夥伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡等等吧，煙霧裡有人被衝散了，也許還躲在樹林裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前你跟他們說好的前進方向是這邊，如果他們還記得，應該會找過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我們只稍微停留一會。天就要亮了，我不會耽誤你們的行程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人也可以放下武器，暫時休息......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......風笛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“葦草”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你就是小丘郡的那個術師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就是那場火的操縱者。我認識你的法術，你讓整條街道變成了灰燼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你讓Outcast為救你而死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你就是深池的“領袖”，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "所有人全都在看著她，在等一個回答。\n這個問題，她從過去到現在聽過許多次。每次聽到的時候，她都需要拼命遏制自己搖頭的欲望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可她想起了乾草垛的觸感和晚風的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起帳篷前躍動的篝火，和槍尖上的火截然不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起遠處還未完全消散的濃煙，那一聲聲呼喊彷彿仍有回聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在小丘郡的時候，我想以死永遠擺脫我的身份，所以源石炮彈落下時我沒有躲開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島救起我之後，我試圖為自己的命運扳回什麼，所以我踏上這趟旅程，試圖撫平一些深池的暴力留下的傷痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但此刻，對於你的這個問題，我只會回答，\n我是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g4_swamp_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些死去的人......因深池而死的人。“塔拉人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深池......欺騙他們了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......過去我會說，那些人的生命，不過是深池之火的燃料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了大局，為了全體塔拉人能起身反抗身上的不公，這把火必須燒得很旺很旺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那些話......在我被Outcast救下，在我重新走過這些路之後，我沒有辦法再說出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上，總有一些死亡，原本是可以避免的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能說，所有的死難者，他們都是為深池的大業而犧牲的......塔拉人是一個又一個活著的，活生生的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得深池犯的錯......尤其是我親手犯下的那些。我不會去掩蓋這些醜陋的傷痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有......“赤鐵近衛隊”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今晚想帶走你的深池士兵，是威靈頓公爵的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......是公爵的私兵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，深池的背後並沒有......也不該有任何勢力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有，那就是......所有想要安寧的家鄉，想在自己的土地上自由行走的塔拉人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是你很怕深池。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是深池真的如你所說，是為了保護塔拉人而戰，那你在害怕什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在怕......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想像中的深池很好，可是實際上裡面全都是暴徒、陰謀家、你控制不了的人。你甚至都被他們扔在了外面，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會否認，許多人在深池的火光裡，看到的不是塔拉人的道路，只是自己的未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想......維多利亞人一磚一石地壘砌自己的家園時，也不會想起，自己在為維多利亞而付出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過，維多利亞人已經有他們的家園和土地了，可以平靜地建造、耕耘。塔拉人想要活著，卻要流很多血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想看見任何人流血。是的，我很害怕，害怕流血，害怕死亡......所以我總想著躲起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去思考，不去感受，就像一個......影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是這樣就可以了嗎？為什麼在我看不見的地方，血......還在流？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葦草......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......風笛。你們之前總是問我，要帶著這些塔拉人往哪裡走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我問你，深池的夢想是不能實現的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "風笛很少覺得失望。\n她想過自己的報告書永遠交不到正確的人手裡，也想過自己的戰友們是在預謀已久的爭端中無謂地犧牲。\n她想過自己再次面對深池的時候要如何瓦解他們的陰謀，從他們手中保護無辜的平民百姓。\n但現在，她看到了小丘郡事件背後只是公爵之間的彼此試探，也看到了葦草身後那幾個從戰火中走出來的塔拉人迷茫又驚惶的眼睛。\n她說不上來自己在對誰失望。\n她不知道自己還能從葦草口中得到什麼答案，就如她同樣回答不了葦草的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......該走了，陳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的任務是調查深池的真相。現在，我聽深池“領袖”親口說清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，葦草幹員聽起來暫時不會跟著我們回羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她還有自己的事要做，我們也有我們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "風、風笛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......維恩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個......送給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收音機？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們之後還要在荒野上趕路吧？拿著這個收音機，說不定能聽到什麼有用的消息......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不需要它了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......哈哈，關於塔拉人的消息，不總是翻來覆去那幾樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "風笛，我們真的很感謝你，感謝陳，感謝那個......羅德島。謝謝你們的帳篷和這一路上的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有......再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見，維恩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "老舊的收音機在風笛手中發出一陣嗞嗞聲。她下意識地放輕了手上的力道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g3_swamp_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凱莉，費加爾，你和我。我們現在就剩下這八個人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人少一些，倒是容易跑路，哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......請幫我找一下，手提箱裡還有沒有乾淨的紗布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "唉，好......\n來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我要把傷口附近的布料揭開，會很疼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......欸，維恩，你沒那麼怕血了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？是、是這麼回事......見了這麼多，怕也沒辦法呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，葦草......風笛真的就這麼走啦？你們不是朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也許，以後有一天還會是，但眼下不可能了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是覺得，雖然她們本來也要走，可是你和她們應該好好告別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人......都應該有一聲道別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——欸，莫蘭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們看見莫蘭借著黎明的微光，一瘸一拐地從遠處走來。\n她的手裡緊緊地攥著一把斷掉的劍，還有一條沾滿鮮血的頭巾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......塞爾蒙的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......莫蘭，她最後......怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沉默地搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，你應該沒能看見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠處的叢林間，戰火燃燒過後的餘煙還在緩緩地升向天空。\n和塞爾蒙一樣，沒有回來的人正躺在那片樹林裡。誰都沒來得及看到，他們最後是什麼樣子。\n倖存者們沉默地注視著飄散的煙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他們所有人，都只是......不知去向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在石高原野，在小丘郡，在橡林郡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她看過許多場大火。在不同的地方，有人謀劃戰爭與災禍，爭奪權力與聲名。\n她看著普通人在其中掙扎，又無緣無故地死去。\n她抬起手，德拉克的火焰生出一朵小小的花。\n握著火焰的感覺依然讓她顫抖，讓她的臟腑疼痛不已，但她卻不再閉上眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為所有......從這片泥濘的土地上爬起來的人們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小小的花朵飄搖落下，跌進沼澤，無聲地枯敗在爛泥之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
